   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "To a place",
   "texto": [
    "**-a/-e** means «a / to»: **okula** (to school), **eve** (to home), **bankaya** (to bank). If the name ends in vowel, **y**: **kafeye** (to the cafeteria) is intercelled.",
    "**Nereye?** = where? **Nereden?** = from where? Compare **okulda** (at school), **okula** (at school) and **okuldan** (from school)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Indications",
   "texto": [
    "**Sağa dön** = turn right; **sola dön** = turn left. **Düz git** = is still straight. **Yakın** means near and **uzak**, far away.",
    "**Buraya** = here; **şuraya** = there (near the interlocutor)."
   ]
  },
